# Echo crystals (EchoCrystal): Octavia trades the Theme of Comedy score, whose short-of-adena
# and no-score pages are shared with the Theme of Battle, for its crystal with exactly 200 adena
# held. Expectations are the reference trace's (EchoCrystal.onTalk, onAdvEvent).
